# surface: duon
# H-1, THE SECOND PROOF, and it reads the bit the first one set. `|` after a
# copula is a UNION edge between descriptors; `|` with no descriptor edge open
# is a PIPE carrying data. The scan needs one bit of edge state, which no
# glyph window of any width can supply.
open(path) = (p): file | error
method: "get" | "post"
sh "ls" | grep("duo")
sh "cat log" | count()
